<section class="day-ppl" aria-labelledby="day-died"><h2 class="ref-sec-title" id="day-died">Died on 28 January <span class="n">7</span></h2><ul class="enc-seealso"><li><a href="/encyclopedia/gao-jixing"><span class="ph ph-person" aria-hidden="true"></span><span><span class="nm">Gao Jixing</span><span class="tp">858–929</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/william-ii-of-holland"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/william-ii-of-holland.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">William II of Holland</span><span class="tp">1227–1256</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/henry-viii-of-england"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/henry-viii-of-england.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Henry VIII of England</span><span class="tp">1491–1547</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/ludvig-holberg"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/ludvig-holberg.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Ludvig Holberg</span><span class="tp">1684–1754</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/eloy-alfaro"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/eloy-alfaro.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">Eloy Alfaro</span><span class="tp">1842–1912</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/w-b-yeats"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/w-b-yeats.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">W. B. Yeats</span><span class="tp">1865–1939</span></span></a></li><li><a href="/encyclopedia/james-scullin"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/thumbs/james-scullin.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" width="44" height="44"><span><span class="nm">James Scullin</span><span class="tp">1876–1953</span></span></a></li></ul></section>
<p class="day-ppl-note">Dates as the sources give them: in the Julian calendar before 1582, and in some countries for longer (Britain until 1752, Russia until 1918). Only people whose day of birth or death the records agree on are listed.</p>
